    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The heads of the fathers' houses of the families of the sons of Gilead the son of Machir, son of Manasseh, of the fathers' houses of the sons of Joseph, came near and spoke before Moses and before the leaders, the heads of the fathers' houses of the people of Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they said, “The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded my lord to give the land for inheritance by lot to the people of Israel; and my lord was commanded by the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to give the inheritance of Zelophehad our brother to his daughters. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But if they are married to any of the sons of the other tribes of the people of Israel then their inheritance will be taken from the inheritance of our fathers, and added to the inheritance of the tribe to which they belong; so it will be taken away from the lot of our inheritance. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And when the jubilee of the people of Israel comes, then their inheritance will be added to the inheritance of the tribe to which they belong; and their inheritance will be taken from the inheritance of the tribe of our fathers.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Moses commanded the people of Israel according to the word of the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", saying, “The tribe of the sons of Joseph is right. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commands concerning the daughters of Zelophehad, ‘Let them marry whom they think best; only, they shall marry within the family of the tribe of their father. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The inheritance of the people of Israel shall not be transferred from one tribe to another; for every one of the people of Israel shall cleave to the inheritance of the tribe of his fathers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And every daughter who possesses an inheritance in any tribe of the people of Israel shall be wife to one of the family of the tribe of her father, so that every one of the people of Israel may possess the inheritance of his fathers. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So no inheritance shall be transferred from one tribe to another; for each of the tribes of the people of Israel shall cleave to its own inheritance.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
